OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother day of scattered
OL,6,Fshowers, occasionally heavy at first,
OL,7,Fand some bright or sunny intervals the
OL,8,Fbest of these towards County Down. A
OL,9,Fwindy day.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few light showers in the
OL,12,Fnorthwest at first. Otherwise dry with
OL,13,Fincreasing clear spells allowing a few
OL,14,Ffog patches to develop and a touch of
OL,15,Frural frost in places.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA chilly start with a few fog
OL,18,Fpatches soon clearing. Otherwise dry
OL,19,Fwith sunny spells by day. Cloudier in
OL,20,Fthe evening with some patchy rain and
OL,21,Ffreshening southeast winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
